<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Failed - Please Update Payment Method</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #0F172A; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f7; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .header .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .failure-box { background: #fffbeb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #fcd34d; }
        .failure-reason { font-size: 16px; color: #92400e; }
        .failure-reason strong { color: #78350f; }
        .amount-box { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .amount { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; }
        .amount-label { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 8px; }
        .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        .details-table td { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .details-table td:first-child { color: #6b7280; }
        .details-table td:last-child { text-align: right; font-weight: 500; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #85182F; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 10px 5px; font-size: 16px; }
        .btn:hover { background: #6D1427; }
        .btn-secondary { background: #ffffff; color: #85182F !important; border: 2px solid #85182F; }
        .retry-info { background: #eff6ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
        .retry-info p { margin: 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 14px; }
        .tips { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .tips h4 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #0F172A; font-size: 14px; }
        .tips ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; }
        .tips li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
        .footer a { color: #85182F; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">💳</div>
            <h1>Payment Unsuccessful</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
            
            <p>We were unable to process your payment. Don't worry - this happens sometimes and is usually easy to fix.</p>
            
            <div class="failure-box">
                <div class="failure-reason">
                    <strong>Reason:</strong> {{failureReason}}
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="amount-box">
                <div class="amount">{{currency}} {{amount}}</div>
                <div class="amount-label">Payment Amount</div>
            </div>
            
            <table class="details-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Invoice Number</td>
                    <td>#{{invoiceNumber}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Payment Method</td>
                    <td>{{paymentMethod}} ending in {{cardLast4}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Attempted On</td>
                    <td>{{attemptDate}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Attempt Number</td>
                    <td>{{attemptNumber}} of {{maxAttempts}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            
            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{updatePaymentUrl}}" class="btn">Update Payment Method</a>
                <a href="{{retryPaymentUrl}}" class="btn btn-secondary">Retry Payment</a>
            </p>
            
            <div class="retry-info">
                <p>📅 We'll automatically retry your payment on <strong>{{nextRetryDate}}</strong>. You can also retry manually or update your payment method anytime.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="tips">
                <h4>Common reasons for payment failure:</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Insufficient funds in your account</li>
                    <li>Card has expired or been replaced</li>
                    <li>Bank declined the transaction (contact your bank)</li>
                    <li>Incorrect billing address on file</li>
                    <li>Card spending limit reached</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p>If you need assistance, our support team is available 24/7 to help resolve this issue.</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The {{companyName}} Billing Team</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>{{companyName}} • {{companyAddress}}</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}">Billing Portal</a> • 
                <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Support</a> • 
                <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Email Preferences</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

